          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kama mwanamume amepata upara, yeye ni safi kwani ana upara tu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwapo upara huo umetanda tangu nyuma mpaka mbele mtu huyo ana upara tu na yu safi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini kama kwenye kichwa penye upara au kwenye paji la uso penye upara kuna alama nyekundu-nyeupe, huo ni ukoma unaotokea kwenye upara wake kichwani au kwenye paji lake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuhani atamwangalia. Iwapo kuhani ataona kuwa huo uvimbe ni mwekundu-mweupe kwenye upara au kwenye paji lake na unaonekana kama ukoma kwenye ngozi yake, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "basi, mtu huyo ana ukoma; yeye ni najisi. Kuhani atamtangaza mtu huyo kuwa najisi. Ugonjwa wake upo kwenye kichwa chake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
